# v 0.1.57
* added summary_FUN to all aggregate functions to allow artibrary summarization of groups.
* added .signed_max() function so that plotDimReduceBins is appropriate for domains including negative values.

# v 0.1.56
* FetchConfig now suppresses view_size application when view_size is NA, NULL, or < 1

# v 0.1.55
* more consistent/predictable internal handling of sample names to allow more robust function behavior - motivated by rbind error

# v 0.1.54
* addRegionAnnotation now handles factors appropriately

# v 0.1.53
* added point_stroke paramter to plotDimReducePoints
* name_FUN now run by .apply_name_FUN to preserve any factor ordering if present

# v 0.1.51
* changed behavior of flipProfilesToMatch to favor strongest signal samples which leads to more intuitive results
* centerProfilesAndRefetch now fully supports summary data and stranded data. Before only unstranded sample data was supported.
* centerProfilesAndRefetch now includes the fetch option use_cache


# v 0.1.50
* added translateSSVtoCT2 and translateSSVtoCT2 to eas interoperability between ssv and ct2

